<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>分页 on 404_@林达</title><link>https://linsk27.github.io/tags/%E5%88%86%E9%A1%B5/</link><description>Recent content in 分页 on 404_@林达</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>404_@林达</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 07 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linsk27.github.io/tags/%E5%88%86%E9%A1%B5/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Element Plus 表格分页、序号与请求状态整理</title><link>https://linsk27.github.io/p/element-plus-%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%E5%88%86%E9%A1%B5%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%95%B4%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://linsk27.github.io/p/element-plus-%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%E5%88%86%E9%A1%B5%E5%BA%8F%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%8E%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%95%B4%E7%90%86/</guid><description>&lt;p>列表页是后台项目最常见的页面之一。表格、分页、筛选、加载状态一起出现后，问题往往不是“表格能不能显示”，而是换页后序号不连续、重复请求、页码没有重置，或者前端排序和服务端分页混在一起。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="跨页连续序号怎么算">跨页连续序号怎么算
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;code>el-table-column&lt;/code> 的 &lt;code>type=&amp;quot;index&amp;quot;&lt;/code> 默认会从 1 开始重新编号。要显示跨页连续序号，可以给它传一个函数：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-vue" data-lang="vue">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table-column&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">type&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;index&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">label&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;序号&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">:index&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;getIndex&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">width&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;72&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">/&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">getIndex&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">index&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="kt">number&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">currentPage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">value&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">pageSize&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">value&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">index&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>例如当前是第 3 页、每页 20 条，当前页第一行的 &lt;code>index&lt;/code> 是 0，最终序号就是 41。&lt;/p>
