&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">v-loading&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;loading&amp;#34; :data=&amp;#34;rows&amp;#34; row-key=&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table-column&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">type&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;index&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">label&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;序号&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">:index&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;getIndex&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">width&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;72&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">/&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table-column&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">prop&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">label&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;用户名&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">min&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">-width&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">=&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="na">160&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">/&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table-column&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">prop&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;status&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">label&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;状态&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">width&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;120&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">/&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-pagination&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="na">v&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">-model:current-page&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;currentPage&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="na">v&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">-model:page-size&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;pageSize&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="na">page&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">-sizes&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">=&amp;#34;[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="na">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">20&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">50&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">100&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">]&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">:total&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;total&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="na">background&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="na">layout&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;total, sizes, prev, pager, next&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">@current-change&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">=&amp;#34;loadUsers&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">@size-change&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">=&amp;#34;changePageSize&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">/&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">template&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>loading&lt;/code> 要在 &lt;code>finally&lt;/code> 中关闭。无论请求成功还是失败，页面都不会一直停在加载状态。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="筛选后为什么要重置页码">筛选后为什么要重置页码
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>用户本来在第 8 页，搜索条件一变，新的结果可能只有 1 页。如果继续带着第 8 页请求，列表就会空掉。因此所有会改变结果集的筛选项，都应该先执行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">currentPage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">value&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">loadUsers&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="服务端分页时排序也交给服务端">服务端分页时，排序也交给服务端
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>如果表格数据来自分页接口，前端只拿到当前页的 20 条数据。此时直接在前端对这 20 条排序，得到的并不是全量排序结果。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>可以监听 &lt;code>sort-change&lt;/code>，把字段名和顺序传回接口：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-vue" data-lang="vue">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">@sort-change&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">=&amp;#34;handleSortChange&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table-column&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">prop&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;createdAt&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">label&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;创建时间&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">sortable&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;custom&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">/&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">el-table&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">sortBy&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">ref&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;createdAt&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">sortOrder&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">ref&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;ascending&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">|&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;descending&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">|&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;descending&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">handleSortChange&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">prop&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">order&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">prop&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="kt">string&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">order&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;ascending&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">|&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;descending&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">|&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">null&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">sortBy&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">value&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">prop&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">sortOrder&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">value&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">order&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">??&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">currentPage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">value&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">loadUsers&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="小结">小结
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>表格页真正需要统一管理的是请求参数和页面状态：页码、每页数量、筛选条件、排序条件、总数与加载状态。把这些状态放在同一处后，分页和表格才不会各自运行、互相打架。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>